{"title":"Docker Firefox","markdown":{"yaml":{"description":"Docker Firefox","output-file":"firefox.html","skip_exec":true,"skip_showdoc":true,"title":"Docker Firefox"},"headingText":"docker-compose.yml","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\n\n<!-- WARNING: THIS FILE WAS AUTOGENERATED! DO NOT EDIT! -->\n\n\n```yml\nservices:\n  firefox:\n    image: lscr.io/linuxserver/firefox:latest\n    container_name: firefox\n    environment:\n      - PUID=1000            # User ID of your host user\n      - PGID=1000            # Group ID of your host user\n      - TZ=Etc/UTC           # Timezone, e.g., \"America/New_York\"\n      - WEBPAGE=https://www.mozilla.org  # Starting URL\n      - VNC_PASSWORD=3719\n      - SUBFOLDER=/firefox  # Access at http://yourdomain.com/firefox\n      - FIREFOX_CLI=https://www.firefox.io/ #optional\n      - MOZ_DISABLE_HW_ACCEL=1   # Disable hardware acceleration\n\n    volumes:\n      - ./config:/config     # Persist configuration data\n    ports:\n      - 3000:3000            # Port mapping\n    shm_size: \"2gb\"          # Shared memory size\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    devices:\n      - /dev/dri:/dev/dri\n\n\n\n```\n\n## To Run\n\n```sh\ndocker-compose up -d\n\n```\n\n## URL\n\n```sh\nhttp://localhost:3000\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n\n\n<!-- WARNING: THIS FILE WAS AUTOGENERATED! DO NOT EDIT! -->\n\n## docker-compose.yml\n\n```yml\nservices:\n  firefox:\n    image: lscr.io/linuxserver/firefox:latest\n    container_name: firefox\n    environment:\n      - PUID=1000            # User ID of your host user\n      - PGID=1000            # Group ID of your host user\n      - TZ=Etc/UTC           # Timezone, e.g., \"America/New_York\"\n      - WEBPAGE=https://www.mozilla.org  # Starting URL\n      - VNC_PASSWORD=3719\n      - SUBFOLDER=/firefox  # Access at http://yourdomain.com/firefox\n      - FIREFOX_CLI=https://www.firefox.io/ #optional\n      - MOZ_DISABLE_HW_ACCEL=1   # Disable hardware acceleration\n\n    volumes:\n      - ./config:/config     # Persist configuration data\n    ports:\n      - 3000:3000            # Port mapping\n    shm_size: \"2gb\"          # Shared memory size\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    devices:\n      - /dev/dri:/dev/dri\n\n\n\n```\n\n## To Run\n\n```sh\ndocker-compose up -d\n\n```\n\n## URL\n\n```sh\nhttp://localhost:3000\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":false,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"jupyter"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","css":["styles.css"],"toc":true,"output-file":"firefox.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"Table of contents","toc-title-website":"On this page","related-formats-title":"Other Formats","related-notebooks-title":"Notebooks","source-notebooks-prefix":"Source","other-links-title":"Other Links","code-links